,"url":"/en/data/taxonomy/services/trade-commodity-and-export-credit-finance","name":"Trade commodity and export credit finance","displayName":"Trade commodity and export credit finance","fields":{"Title":{"value":"Trade, commodity and export credit finance"},"color":null,"link":{"value":{"class":"","id":"{24EDBFC9-73BB-4300-8684-1B1BFD90BC0F}","querystring":"","anchor":"","target":"","title":"Trade commodity and export credit finance","linktype":"internal","text":"Trade commodity and export credit finance","url":"/AOShearman/AOShearman/Home/all-expertise/trade-commodity-and-export-credit-finance","href":"/en/expertise/trade-commodity-and-export-credit-finance"}},"userFacingTitle":{"value":"Trade, commodity and export credit finance"},"relatedTags":[],"mappingValue":{"value":"S118"}}}],"specificTags":[],"topicTags":[],"blogTags":[]}},{"id":"93a1320d-5d47-4507-8194-657890e585d9","url":"/en/data/people-profile-directory/ken-rivlin","name":"ken-rivlin","displayName":"Ken Rivlin","fields":{"email":{"value":"ken.rivlin@aoshearman.com"},"phone":{"value":"+1 212 610 6460"},"otherPhone":{"value":""},"fraudulentEmailFlag":{"value":"1"},"employeeID":{"value":"0281023"},"image":{"value":{"src":"https://edge.sitecorecloud.io/allenoveryllp1-aoshearmanwe0db-production-ecf3/media/project/aoshearman/aoshearman/people-profile---assets/r/i/rivlin_ken_0281023_webz.jpg?h=1520\u0026iar=0\u0026w=2026","alt":"Image of Ken Rivlin","width":"2026","height":"1520"}},"customTitlePrefix":{"value":""},"fullName":{"value":"Ken Rivlin"},"firstName":{"value":"Ken"},"lastName":{"value":"Rivlin"},"jobTitle":{"value":"Partner"},"otherOffices":[],"bioIntro":{"value":"Ken is a preeminent international lawyer, widely sought for his expertise on environment and trade, as well as his skill in complex problem-solving and strategic decision-making.\u003cbr /\u003e"},"mainBio":{"value":"\u003cp\u003eHe is Co-Head of A\u0026amp;O Shearman\u0026rsquo;s Environment \u0026amp; Climate Law Group and the Firm\u0026rsquo;s International Trade Group, an elected member of the Firm\u0026rsquo;s Board (now serving a second term), and Chair of the Firm\u0026rsquo;s Risk Committee. His directory rankings reflect his prominence, including Chambers USA (Ranked Band 1), The Legal 500 (\u0026ldquo;Hall of Fame\u0026rdquo;), The Legal 500 Green Guide (\u0026ldquo;Green Ambassador\u0026rdquo;), and Lexology (\u0026ldquo;Thought Leader\u0026rdquo;).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe is uniquely experienced helping corporates, financial institutions, investment funds, multilateral organizations, and NGOs manage risk and exploit opportunity in the context of transactions, compliance, and disputes.\u0026nbsp; Particular areas of expertise include environmental \u0026amp; climate risk, sanctions, foreign direct investment (CFIUS \u0026amp; the U.S. Outbound Investment Security Program), export controls, supply chain sustainability, emission trading, supply chain sustainability, and public reporting and disclosure. His sector expertise is deep and broad, ranging from tech \u0026amp; AI, financial services, and consumer products - to manufacturing, infrastructure, and transportation - to energy, chemicals, mining and defense. Clients describe him as \u0026ldquo;\u0026hellip;one of a kind,\u0026rdquo; \u0026ldquo;a sharp, diligent and savvy lawyer,\u0026rdquo; and a \u0026ldquo;unique Swiss army knife\u0026rdquo; who has a \u0026ldquo;breadth of experience [and] great judgment.\u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKen has been a Lecturer-in-Law at Columbia University School of Law for over 20 years and is the former Chair of the New York City Bar Committee on International Environmental Law. He serves and has served on numerous boards, including as a current Trustee and former Board President for the Human Needs Food Pantry, Inc., former Chair of the Advisory Council for the Institute at Brown (University) for Environment \u0026amp; Society, and as a former board member for Pure Earth.\u003c/p\u003e"},"recognitions":[{"id":"90f275ee-b956-42dc-a5b9-7f00a9a69784","url":"/en/data/people-profile-directory/ken-rivlin/recognitions/recognition 1","name":"Recognition 1","displayName":"Recognition 1","fields":{"source":{"value":"Chambers USA, Environment: Mainly Transactional, 2025"},"text":{"value":"He is well-connected and has breadth of experience, great judgment and excellent people skills."}}},{"id":"787d77a4-44f7-44f4-8b1e-ff1df32a061a","url":"/en/data/people-profile-directory/ken-rivlin/recognitions/recognition 2","name":"Recognition 2","displayName":"Recognition 2","fields":{"source":{"value":"Chambers USA, Environment: Mainly Transactional, 2025"},"text":{"value":"Ken is practical and easy to work with - when he's on a deal I know it's going to be smooth."}}}],"awards":{"value":"\u003cul\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eChambers \u0026amp; Partners (Ranked Band 1)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eLegal 500 (Ranked as \u0026ldquo;Hall of Fame\u0026rdquo;)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eLegal 500 Green Guide (Ranked as \"Green Ambassador\")\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eWho\u0026rsquo;s Who Legal Thought Leaders (Ranked as \u0026ldquo;Recommended\u0026rdquo;)\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eLexology Index: Environment \u0026amp; Climate (Ranked as \"Thought Leader\")\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"},"globalPracticeArea":{"value":""},"jobRole":{"id":"2dad2dee-a735-4348-a5d7-d04fc10f42be","url":"/en/data/job-roles/partner","name":"Partner","displayName":"Partner","fields":{"jobRole":{"value":"Partner"},"listingOrder":{"value":1}}},"office":{"id":"883cc7e5-20cd-4109-8114-17f3e979b631","url":"/en/data/offices/new-york","name":"New York","displayName":"New York","fields":{"postcode":{"value":""},"secondaryTelephone":{"value":""},"telephone":{"value":"+1 212 848 4000"},"addressLine1":{"value":"599 Lexington Avenue"},"addressLine2":{"value":"New York NY 10022"},"addressLine3":{"value":""},"city":{"value":""},"country":{"id":"ec35b